---
kind: lore
id: north.cinderisle
title: Cinder Isle
state:
  scene.quizScore: { type: number, default: 0 }
---

// Cinder Isle: a volcano with a town on its shoulder. The Blaze Gym (locked
// with the Volcano Key from the burned mansion), the inn, the volcano lab.

// ── arriving ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

<beat id="arrive" on="enterTown" target="town.cinderisle" title="Cinder Isle" priority="10">
  ::bg{location="cinder-isle" time="day"}
  ::music{action="change" mood="upbeat" volume="normal"}
  @narrator: Cinder Isle is black sand, white steam and red roofs. The volcano above the town grumbles like a sleeping dog.
  @narrator: On the hill stands the Blaze Gym, its doors chained. Past it, the shell of a burned mansion leans against the sky.
</beat>

<entry id="northCinderMorning" on="enterTown" target="town.cinderisle" category="bark" once="day" when="@isMorning">
  @narrator: Morning mist mixes with the steam vents. Somebody is boiling eggs in a hot spring by the dock.
</entry>

<entry id="northCinderDay" on="enterTown" target="town.cinderisle" category="bark" once="day" when="run.slot == 'day'">
  @narrator: The sand is too hot to stand on. Everyone on Cinder Isle walks on the boardwalks.
</entry>

<entry id="northCinderNight" on="enterTown" target="town.cinderisle" category="bark" once="day" when="@isNight">
  @narrator: At night the volcano's rim glows, and the whole town is lit the color of embers.
</entry>

// ── services ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

<beat id="center" on="heal" target="town.cinderisle" title="Monster Center" once="false">
  ::use{component="nurse" town="cinderisle"}
</beat>

<beat id="mart" on="shop" target="town.cinderisle" title="Mart" once="false">
  ::use{component="shop" stock="cinderisleStock"}
</beat>

// ── Innkeeper Sol ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

<entry id="northSolBark" on="talk" target="npc.cinderInnkeeper" category="bark">
  @cinderInnkeeper: Welcome to the Caldera Inn. The baths are volcano-heated. The rooms are also volcano-heated, which is less popular.
</entry>

<entry id="northSolMorning" on="talk" target="npc.cinderInnkeeper" category="bark" priority="5" when="@isMorning">
  @cinderInnkeeper: Breakfast is spring-boiled eggs. Lunch is spring-boiled eggs. You see where this is going.
</entry>

<entry id="northSolNight" on="talk" target="npc.cinderInnkeeper" category="bark" priority="5" when="@isNight">
  @cinderInnkeeper: Don't mind the rumbling at night. It's the volcano, not the plumbing. Probably.
</entry>

// ── Dr. Ashby, the volcanologist ────────────────────────────────────────────

<entry id="northAshbyBark" on="talk" target="npc.cinderVolcanologist" category="bark">
  @cinderVolcanologist{emotion="worried"}: The seismographs have been twitching since someone started poking around the old mansion lab. I don't like it.
</entry>

<entry id="northAshbyKey" on="talk" target="npc.cinderVolcanologist" category="bark" priority="5" when="holds(hasItem(volcanoKey))">
  @cinderVolcanologist{emotion="surprised"}: You found the Volcano Key in that ruin? Ignatius swore it melted in the fire. Hah. That old showman.
</entry>

<entry id="northAshbyBadge" on="talk" target="npc.cinderVolcanologist" category="bark" priority="6" when="holds(hasBadge(blaze))">
  @cinderVolcanologist: The readings calmed down the day you beat Ignatius. I'm writing that up as coincidence. Officially.
</entry>

// ── the Gym Guide ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

<entry id="northCinderGuideLocked" on="talk" target="npc.cinderGymGuide" category="bark" when="!holds(canPass(cinderGymDoor))">
  @cinderGymGuide: Yo! Champ in the making! Bad news: Ignatius locked the gym and threw the key into the old mansion. He says only a trainer brave enough to fetch it deserves a battle.
</entry>

<entry id="northCinderGuideOpen" on="talk" target="npc.cinderGymGuide" category="bark" priority="1" when="holds(canPass(cinderGymDoor)) && !holds(defeated(ignatius))">
  @cinderGymGuide: You got the key! Okay, listen: Ignatius uses fire, fire and more fire. Water beats it, rock beats it, and the quiz machines inside beat everybody. Study!
</entry>

<entry id="northCinderGuideWon" on="talk" target="npc.cinderGymGuide" category="bark" priority="2" when="holds(defeated(ignatius))">
  @cinderGymGuide: The Blaze Badge! You're scorching! One gym left, in Verdant City. Nobody I know has ever seen that leader's face.
</entry>

// ── Granny Ember and her quiz ───────────────────────────────────────────────
// Once a day: three questions; all three right earns a Rare Candy.

<beat id="grannyQuiz" on="talk" target="npc.cinderGranny" title="Granny Ember's quiz" once="day" priority="10">
  ::auto{character="cinderGranny" anchor="center" action="enter"}
  @cinderGranny{emotion="laughing"}: A young trainer! Sit, sit. Ignatius learned his quizzes from me, you know. Three questions. Get them all and Granny has a treat.
  <branch id="northQuizOne" prompt="Which type puts out a fire?">
    <choice id="water" label="Water">
      ::set{scene.quizScore += 1}
      @cinderGranny: Of course. Even a bucket knows that.
    </choice>
    <choice id="grass" label="Grass">
      @cinderGranny: Grass? Dear, grass is what fire eats for breakfast.
    </choice>
  </branch>
  <branch id="northQuizTwo" prompt="What does the Volcano Key open?">
    <choice id="gym" label="The Blaze Gym">
      ::set{scene.quizScore += 1}
      @cinderGranny: Right. Silly boy, locking his own gym.
    </choice>
    <choice id="volcano" label="The volcano">
      @cinderGranny: Hah! Nobody opens the volcano. The volcano opens itself.
    </choice>
  </branch>
  <branch id="northQuizThree" prompt="How many badges before Victory Road lets you in?">
    <choice id="seven" label="Seven">
      @cinderGranny: Seven gets you into the Earth Gym. Victory Road wants more.
    </choice>
    <choice id="eight" label="Eight">
      ::set{scene.quizScore += 1}
      @cinderGranny: Eight. All of them. No shortcuts in Verdane.
    </choice>
  </branch>
  <match on="scene.quizScore">
    <when is="3..">
      @cinderGranny{emotion="happy"}: Three out of three! Here, a sweet for your strongest one.
      ::give{item="rareCandy"}
    </when>
    <when is="1..2">
      @cinderGranny: {{scene.quizScore}} out of three. Come back tomorrow, Granny will ask again.
    </when>
    <otherwise>
      @cinderGranny: Not a single one! Oh, you remind me of Ignatius at your age.
    </otherwise>
  </match>
</beat>

<entry id="northGrannyBark" on="talk" target="npc.cinderGranny" category="bark">
  @cinderGranny: One quiz a day, dear. Granny's brain needs a nap in between.
</entry>
